.Dd November 9, 2026
.Dt GLXDEMO 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm glxdemo
.Nd a demonstration of the GLX functions
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Ss "SYNOPSIS"
.Bd -literal
     glxdemo
.Ed
.Ss "DESCRIPTION"
.Bd -literal
     The glxdemo program shows how to use the GLX functions in order to create
     an OpenGL program running on top of an X server. This program is most
     useful when studied in its source code form.
.Ed
